I combined the early-return checks into a single conditional assignment, so the common profile-field path falls through without a taken branch while preserving all edge-case behavior.

```cpp
FIT_UINT8 Field::GetType() const
{
    FIT_UINT8 result = type;
    if (result == FIT_UINT8_INVALID &&
        profile != NULL &&
        profileIndex < profile->numFields)
    {
        result = profile->fields[profileIndex].type;
    }
    return result;
}
```